    "description": "Before beginning the upper-division major, students are advised to consult the department regarding the scheduling of required courses.\nNote: All Language and Speech Technology courses except Linguistics 102 have prerequisites and must be taken in order. Most courses have Linguistics 102 as a prerequisite, so it should be taken as early as possible. One advanced two-course sequence (Linguistics 104 & 105 OR Linguistics 110 & 111 OR Linguistics 110 & 119) must be completed. Because of the prerequisite structure, it must be completed in order.\n40 UD units are required"
